WEBVTT

00:09:29.121 --> 00:09:33.121
and ethics. And we got super
deep into resetting.

00:09:33.121 --> 00:09:36.454
How we can possibly reset the tech
industry is moral compass.

00:09:37.246 --> 00:09:39.329
But months after we taped that interview,

00:09:39.412 --> 00:09:43.204
Gregg told me about a concept that has
nothing to do with the tech industry

00:09:43.746 --> 00:09:47.621
and a lot to do with rethinking
how we live and work.

00:09:48.246 --> 00:09:53.954
Maybe you've already heard of the Neutral
Zone? I had not. Here's Greg.

00:09:55.704 --> 00:09:59.287
I'm Anoush, it is Greg Epstein here,

00:09:59.287 --> 00:10:03.287
and I'm finally getting a chance to
record this voice memo for you,